title: intermediate goals to triage
pid: 969510aa-da4e-499a-b083-1a37c187167e
body: |2-
  - Communicate. Sometimes this should be high-order:
    we'll need to think at least occasionally
    about how we talk to each other.
  - Think (in your own notes).
  - Dream?
  - Make it correct.
  - Make it user-friendly.
  - Document (for others).
  - Address technical debt.
  - Test.
